---

Ars Nouveau is a **separate jar**: [Spell Codex Ars Compat](/mods/spell-codex-ars-compat).

It adds a Spell Conversion Station. Place a caster tome, click **Add to Codex**, and that glyph recipe becomes an Ars Nouveau school card on this Codex. You still need [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar). Casting spends Iron’s mana, not Ars source.
